$mws_app_hello $mol_page
	title \Stale task repro
	body /
		<= Count $mol_view
			sub / <= page_label \
		<= Button $mol_button_major
			title \Next page
			click?event <=> next?event null
		<= Rows $mol_paragraph
			title <= rows_label \
		<= Requests $mol_paragraph
			title <= requests_label \
		<= Hint $mol_paragraph
			title <= hint \
